  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "12",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1KI 12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kukudumbua kwa vichuku va kaskazinyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rehoboamu ukaghenda Shekemu andu Waisraeli wose werekwanyikieghe wipate kum'bonya mzuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao iji Jeroboamu mwana wa Nebati wasikira agho, (angu orekoghe Misri kwa kumkimbia Mzuri Solomoni), ukawuya kufuma Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wa Israeli wikamdumia Jeroboamu momu uche kwawo. Jeroboamu na ikwanyiko jose ja Israeli wikacha na kumzera Rehoboamu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ndeyo Solomoni orediwikirieghe ghongolo ilemere. Idana dakulomba kudipunguzire rija kazi ndeyo oredinekieghe, rikakaia sa ghongolo ilemere aighu kodu, nesi dichakudumikia.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukawitumbulia, “Ghendenyi mkaie matuku adadu ima muche nimtumbulie.” Niko awo wandu wikaghenda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Rehoboamu ukawikotia njama waja waghosi werekoghe wanjama wa ndee Solomoni ngelo orekoghe moyo, ukighamba, “Mwawona awa wandu niwitumbulia wada?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikamzera, “Kukakunda kuwidumikie awa wandu, kudedanye nawo nicha, nawo wichakudumikia kwa wuloli matuku ghose.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Rehoboamu ukaimenya ija njama ya waghosi, ukaghenda kulola njama ya wandu wa irika wizoghuanye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukawikotia, “Mwawona diwitumbulie wada awa wandu werenilombieghe niwipunguzire kazi werenekeloghe ni aba?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikamtumbulia, “Kuwizere huwu: ‘Chala chapo cha mwanake ni kirifu kuchumba kiwonu cha aba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba oremdukishireghe misigo ilemere, ini nichamdukishira ilemere kuchumba; oremdamieghe na kiboko, ela ini nichamdama na kiboko cha mbela.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ituku ja kadadu, Jeroboamu ukawuya chiaimweri na waja wandu wose sa iji koni werelaghiriloghe ni mzuri Rehoboamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzuri ukamenya njama ya waghosi, ukadedanya na waja wandu kwa kubia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukadedanya nawo kunughana na njama orenekeloghe ni wandu wa irika, ukighamba, “Aba oremdukishireghe misigo ilemere, ela ini nichamdukishira ilemere kuchumba; oremkabieghe na kiboko, ela ini nichamkaba na kiboko cha mbela.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ugho ghodeeka ni mpango ghwa Mlungu, eri malagho oremghorieghe Jeroboamu mwana wa Nebati kwa momu ghwa mlodi Ahija Mshiloni ghipate kukatia; niko Rehoboamu useredimieghe kuinugha ija njama ya waghosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao iji wandu wose wa Israeli wawona kukaia mzuri nderewisikireghe, wikamtumbulia mzuri,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wulodi ghwa Shemaia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata iji Rehoboamu wavika Jerusalemu, ukawiwanga masikari ghiko mang'oni wa mbari ya Juda na Benjamini wandu elfu ighana na mirongo wunyanya, wipate kulwa na wuzuri ghwa kaskazinyi ghwa Israeli, upate kughuwunja ugho wuzuri kwa Rehoboamu mwana wa Solomoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Mlungu ukamzera mlodi Shemaia ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "umzere Rehoboamu mwana wa Solomoni, mzuri wa Juda na wandu wose wa kichuku cha Juda na Benjamini huwu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Msejoke kulwa na wanyinyu wandu wa Israeli. Wuyenyi kula mundu mzinyi kwake, kwa kukaia ilagho iji jaafuma kwapo.” Nao wikamsikira BWANA, wikaghenda cha mizinyi kwawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jeroboamu kumsigha BWANA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzuri Jeroboamu wa Israeli ukaagha ngome Shekemu, isanga ja mighondinyi ja Efraimu, ukakaia aho. Ukafuma aho na kuagha Penueli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jeroboamu ukaririkanya ngolonyi kwake, “Wuzuri ughu ghwadima kuwuya kwa nyumba ya Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awandu wikajoka kufunya vizongona kwa BWANA Hekalunyi Jerusalemu, wadima kughalusa maghesho ghawo wimmburie Mzuri Rehoboamu wa Juda, nawo winibwaghe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuma ya kujipima, ukachana ngache iwi ra dhahabu. Ukawizera wandu, “Mduajokali Jerusalemu; milungu yenyu hei ee wandu wa Israeli, iyo eremjosereghe kufuma isanga ja Misri.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.32.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuf. 32.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukawika ngache imu Betheli, na imu ukaiwika Dani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilagho iji jikawuya kaung'a, kwa kukaia wandu wamu werekoghe wikighenda kutasa hata Dani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.30"
            ]
